{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_23351","headline":"有感三首 一 · 白居易","name":"有感三首 一","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"鬓发已斑白，衣绶方朱紫。\n穷贱当壮年，富荣临暮齿。\n车舆红尘合，第宅青烟起。\n彼来此须去，品物之常理。\n第宅非吾庐，逆旅暂留止。\n子孙非我有，委蜕而已矣。\n有如蚕造茧，又似花生子。\n子结花暗凋，茧成蚕老死。\n悲哉可奈何，举世皆如此。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"白居易","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_23351.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_23351","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}